menu "Panda Status"

config PS_LED_COUNT
    int "LED count on the bar (PROVISIONAL)"
    default 8
    range 1 255
    help
        Unknown until the bench session counts the bar and the block list is read off the
        device. Nothing in the repository establishes it. Runtime config does not override
        this; the number is a build fact until it is a measured one.

config PS_LED_GPIO
    int "LED data GPIO (PROVISIONAL)"
    default 8
    help
        Unknown until the board is traced. Set from the hardware note, not from a guess.

config PS_WS_MAX_CLIENTS
    int "Concurrent WebSocket clients"
    default 4

endmenu
